# Project Overview

## Application Type
Multi-role rental property management platform

## Tech Stack
- **Framework**: Next.js 15 with App Router
- **UI Library**: React 19
- **Language**: TypeScript 5
- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS 3.4
- **Deployment**: Cloudflare Pages

## User Roles
The application supports 5 distinct user roles with role-based access control:
- **ADMIN** - Full system access, user/profile management
- **SUPPORT** - Account verification, user administration
- **LANDLORD** - Property/unit/contract management, tenant requests
- **MANAGER** - Same as landlord (manages on behalf of property owners)
- **RENTER** - Browse properties, submit applications, view contracts

## Key Features
- Multi-profile user system (one user, multiple roles)
- Property management (4 types: Complex, Studio, Room, Apartment)
- Contract & invoice management
- Maintenance request system
- Multi-language support (English/French)
- Document uploads to Cloudflare R2
- Role-based route protection via middleware

## External Services
- **Cloudflare Workers** - Backend API for user/property data
- **Cloudflare R2** - Object storage for images/documents
- **Firebase Auth** - Initial authentication only

## Environment
- Development: Turbopack
- Production: Cloudflare Pages (Edge runtime)
- Session: Custom JWT (HTTP-only cookies, 1hr expiry)
